# Pattern source for the F73 token-pattern scanner. Copy to
# .private-infra-patterns (gitignored) and populate; CI loads the same
# content from the PRIVATE_INFRA_PATTERNS repo secret.
#
# Format: one regex per line. Optional `label:regex` shape lets the
# failure message name the category. `#` comments + blank lines skipped.
# Malformed regex lines are warned about and skipped — the gate stays
# usable with a partial pattern set.
#
# Examples (placeholders only — replace with literal strings to match):

# label-a:  \b<literal-token-a>\b
# label-b:  \b<literal-token-b>\b
# label-c:  \b<domain-prefix>\.(?:com|io|ai)\b
# label-d:  \b(?:<alt-1>|<alt-2>)\b
